        "reason": "Correctly defines redox reactions as electron-transfer reactions, oxidation as electron loss, and reduction as electron gain.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "kind": "STUDY_SUPPORT",
      "label": "Mnemonic aids for remembering oxidation and reduction (including OIL RIG)",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "قاعدة سهلة للحفظ:\n\n> **أكسدة = فقد إلكترونات**  \n> **اختزال = اكتساب إلكترونات**\n\nبالإنجليزية يمكن تذكّرها بعبارة:  \n**OIL RIG**  \nOxidation Is Loss  \nReduction Is Gain",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
